      "body": "precedent I'm aware of: https://github.com/mozilla/legal-docs/issues?q=is%3Aissue+is%3Aclosed\r\n\r\nmy old colleague, @mattbasta, helped the Legal + Privacy folks start using GitHub for maintaining their docs in Markdown (version control is really helpful for them!)\r\n\r\n**https://github.com/mozilla/legal-docs**\r\n\r\nI'd check with @mikaland2, [et. al.](https://github.com/mozilla/legal-docs/graphs/contributors) to see if it's cool: it'd be awesome to get Hubs' docs in there :+1: (I should do the same for the Unity WebVR Assets.)",
