      "body": "TBH, I'm not sure across the board. in past projects, we filed Bugzilla issues and then opened PRs in [`mozilla/legal-docs`](https://github.com/mozilla/legal-docs). as long as there are issues on file (or protocols in place) to sync (or link to) the versions in `mozilla/legal-docs`, it's probably fine to keep the issues in that repo. probably err on the side of duplicated issues, but yeah this is likely a question for @mikaland2 to answer.",
